{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11201005","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11201005","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1120100501:0":{"text":"子どもたちよ、私のもとへ来なさい……あなたたちは、恒久の幸福を手に入れるでしょう。","source_cn":"孩子，勇敢地向我走来……你们，正在接近永恒的幸福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA26C3240FACA2DD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120100502:0":{"text":"アンお姉ちゃん、これ、本当に残陽神様じゃないの？幸福は分かるけど、「こーきゅー」って何？","source_cn":"安丹姐姐，说话的真的不是残阳神吗？幸福我懂，可永恒是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x608B793CBDD484F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120100503:0":{"text":"いや、残陽神は恒久など信じていないはずだ。ココ、気をつけよう。","source_cn":"不，我认为残阳神并不相信永恒。卡卡，我们要更加小心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA561BA409B74C12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的呼唤":{"text":"謎の声","source":"神秘的呼唤","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"ココ","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"アンダンドラ","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}